{"id":"nachricht","lemma":"Nachricht","pos":"noun","rank":514,"glosses":["news, piece of news, notification","message (information which is sent from a source to a receiver)","news (kind of broadcast)"],"ipa":"/ˈnaːxrɪçt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/De-at-Nachricht.ogg/De-at-Nachricht.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Nachricht","plural":"Nachrichten"},"formAudio":{"Nachrichten":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/43/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Nachrichten.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Keine Nachricht, gute Nachricht.","en":"No news is good news.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/816","words":[{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Ich hörte die gute Nachricht.","en":"I heard the good news.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756916","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Es war eine gute Nachricht.","en":"It was good news.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389941","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Die Nachricht kann nicht wahr sein.","en":"The news can't be true.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758519","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,null,{"g":"to be"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"right?"]]},{"text":"Ich habe eine Nachricht.","en":"I have a message.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/167145","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}